WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.960
Should Christians celebrate Halloween?
Well, a lot of people including a lot of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:17.000
Christians, they just think about the activities.
They like dressing up as ghosts, witches,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.760
or even demons or some other sort&nbsp;
of spiritual or mythical creature.&nbsp;

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.720
They do it for fun, to trick&nbsp;
and treat, or to go to parties.&nbsp;

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.760
On the other hand, some people celebrate&nbsp;
Halloween because they want to remember the dead.&nbsp;

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:34.880
That is actually what Halloween was created for.
Some Christians even go to church and they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:39.680
light candles on the graves of&nbsp;
those who passed away already.&nbsp;

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:43.800
So Halloween was a celebration&nbsp;
to honor or remember the dead.&nbsp;

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:58.320
It was called All Hallows Eve, but many people&nbsp;
can trace it back all the way to the pagans.

